        "Content": "<ul><li>Beautifully preserved Georgian home extending to approx. 5,000 sq. ft.</li><li>38 acres of southerly facing, free-draining lands.</li><li>Stable yard with six stables, coach house, barn and a large all-weather menage.</li><li>Mature gardens, ornamental pond, tennis court, and woodland.</li><li>Peaceful rural setting with superb connectivity to Dublin City and Airport via the M2/N2.</li><li>Additional lands and a farmyard available separately as required.</li></ul>"
